# Leave unset for local dev — requests go to relative /api/... paths, which
# the Vite dev server proxies to the backend (see vite.config.js). This is
# what makes testing from a phone on the same network/hotspot work without
# hardcoding your laptop's LAN IP anywhere.
#
# Set this explicitly only for a production build, where there's no dev
# server to proxy through — point it at wherever the API is actually hosted:
# VITE_API_BASE=https://api.example.com
